{"title":"2016 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The graph shows the number of hours Stan worked on a school project.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>For how many hours in total did he work on the project?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/1/5e17df382242c4eea0e059b92c81b089361e7c3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 6 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 2 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 8 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 9 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the bar chart, we can just find how many hours he worked on the project each day of the week, and add it all up.\n</p><p>On Monday, he worked for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours.\n</p><p>On Tuesday, he worked for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours.\n</p><p>On Wednesday, he worked for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours.\n</p><p>On Thursday, he worked for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hour.\n</p><p>On Friday, he worked for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours.\n</p><p>Thus, in total, he worked for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/0/c20124485898a5f83ec9b17c878214db1d371884.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 0 + 3 + 1 + 2 = 2 + 3 + 1 + 2 = 5 + 1 + 2 = 6 + 2 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"504\" height=\"30\" /> hours.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2016 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2016 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" hr